  "bodyHash": "720c26856b493ed3",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><strong>关于</strong></h2>\n<p>Arts &amp; Crafts 主要为创造模式与生存模式的建造添加了多种独特的建筑方块！&nbsp; 本模组由 KekeCreations 和 Arbeet 制作！&nbsp; 我们将持续更新此模组以适配更高版本！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_da9cd1cd-65a6-4193-85ee-55c3bba1a3d3.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>兼容性</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Arts &amp; Crafts V1.3.0</strong> 包含一个<strong>用于禁用功能的配置项</strong>，可关闭需要大量兼容支持的功能，例如染色花盆或染色装饰陶罐。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>在 Arts &amp; Crafts V1.3.0 中，染色装饰陶罐现已兼容所有陶片！</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>如果您正在寻找不同模组与 Arts &amp; Crafts 之间的兼容性</strong>，您可以下载 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artsandcrafts-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arts &amp; Crafts Compatibility</a>！</p>\n<p>如果您希望在自己的模组中添加画笔的兼容功能，可以参考 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkekecreations.boomla.net%252fmods%252fminecraft-java-edition%252farts-and-crafts\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的网站</a> 上的文档了解具体操作方法！&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; <img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_b38592c3-a7cc-4fe8-a654-a38e70f9214e.png\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_46654742-e7f0-4eeb-a776-1897f1625b2f.png\"></p>\n<h2><strong>功能特性</strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_da5b20ee-a039-4ea8-8816-66dfa7577fc0.png\"><br></strong></h2>\n<p>如需了解更多关于本模组功能的详细信息，请查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkekecreations.boomla.net%252fmods%252fminecraft-java-edition%252farts-and-crafts\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处 wiki</a>！&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>粉笔</li>\n<li>粉笔棒</li>\n<li>软木</li>\n<li>染色陶罐</li>\n<li>石膏</li>\n<li>莲花</li>\n<li>画笔</li>\n<li>彩绘泥砖</li>\n<li>灰泥</li>\n<li>瓦片</li>\n<li>滑石</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_6b87bc64-2f00-4f70-9c04-94fb99d2fbf7.png\"></p>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>特别感谢&nbsp;<strong>ExDrill</strong>&nbsp;制作了画笔的绘画音效并搭建了画笔数据包相关内容！[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fExDrill_\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>]</li>\n<li>感谢 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fOther_Goblin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel Goblin</a> 提议添加彩绘泥砖！</li>\n<li>感谢 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fThatJadenXgamer\" rel=\"nofollow\">JadenXGamer</a> 制作了自定义的滑石和软木音效！</li>\n<li>特别感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/Iamnotagenius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iamnotagenius</a> 允许我在 Fabric 端使用其配置代码！<br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fCreationsKeke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_1c7c6ef7-e88e-4f20-bb69-5db02edebb00.png\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fariana-bit.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_0e75891e-bc9e-4760-bfce-803c7a732b42.png\"></a><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1034791/description_46654742-e7f0-4eeb-a776-1897f1625b2f.png\"></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
